Infect a target's mind with a virulent whisper that deals [184, 248, 297, 339, 376 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Mind damage and spreads amongst your foes, dealing damage and feeding you [1.0, 2.3, 3.4, 4.2, 5.0 (TL1-5)] Hate for each new victim. Each turn for [1, 2, 3, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] turns, the initial victim will spread the whisper to a new target within [2, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)] tiles if one is available; beyond this, all affected targets have a [15%, 21%, 25%, 30%, 33% (TL1-5)] chance of spreading the effect each turn for 4 turns.

Targets damaged by this ability have a 25% chance of suffering Brainlock.

The damage increases with your Mindpower.
